    "body": "I suspect that is a bug for CSP as well as this. I would expect this policy to \"inherit\" into (same-origin) about:blank, srcdoc, blobs, javascript URL.\r\n\r\nCross-origin srcdoc (due to sandbox) and data URLs are a bit trickier. I guess nothing should happen there for these.\r\n\r\n(And yeah, we need policy infrastructure so this is not a per-policy treasure hunt.)",
